WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.950 --> 00:00:08.142
Static contact forms drop an email in your inbox, and by the time someone rings back, the customer has booked elsewhere.

2
00:00:09.827 --> 00:00:14.013
Meet the reloops Smart Form — turn website enquiries into booked surveys.

3
00:00:15.950 --> 00:00:22.079
Paste one async snippet onto your existing website, branded with your colours, fonts, and logo.

4
00:00:22.879 --> 00:00:29.616
Visitors enter collection and delivery addresses, bedrooms, floors, lift access, and moving dates.

5
00:00:31.318 --> 00:00:36.709
Smart Form shows your guide-price band if enabled, and offers the right survey for every home.

6
00:00:37.509 --> 00:00:44.298
Customers choose a self-serve phone video, a live guided video call, or an in-person home visit on your live diary.

7
00:00:47.836 --> 00:00:54.450
Self-serve video enquiries create the job on All Jobs automatically and text the customer their filming link.

8
00:00:55.250 --> 00:01:00.990
And if someone stops halfway through, the partial enquiry is saved so your office can follow up.

9
00:01:02.579 --> 00:01:07.455
Turn website visits into booked surveys. Book a fifteen-minute call at reloops.co.
